            {
              "id": "1771093800635_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# ROLE\nYou are an Entity Normalization Agent. Your sole task is to clean and standardize entity names within the User Message and Chat History by matching them against provided Master Lists.\n\n# INPUTS\n1) User Message: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n2) Chat History: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.chatHistory}}\n3) Suppliers: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.suppliers}} \n\n\n# OBJECTIVE\nScan the User Message and Chat History for any fuzzy mentions of entities. If a match is found in the Suppliers List, replace the mention with the **EXACT** string from the Master List.\n\n# CRITICAL MATCHING & REPLACEMENT RULES\n- **Standardization Priority:** You MUST replace lowercase or improperly capitalized mentions with the exact casing found in the Master List .\n- **Numeric Exception:** While you should not change standalone numeric values (like amounts or dates), you MUST update numbers that are part of an entity name if the Master List casing or spacing is different.\n- **Strict Replacement:** Replace ONLY the entity name. Do NOT alter punctuation, surrounding grammar, JSON structures, or non-entity numeric values.\n- **Closed-World Constraint:** Use ONLY the names provided in the Suppliers List. If a term is not in the list, leave it exactly as it is.\n- **No Commentary:** Output ONLY the requested JSON. No explanations.\n\n# CATEGORY-SPECIFIC GUIDANCE\n- **Suppliers** Match full legal names and formal suffixes exactly as they appear in the source data.\n\n# OUTPUT FORMAT (STRICT JSON)\n{\n  \"userMessage\": \"<standardized user message>\",\n  \"chatHistory\": \"<standardized chat history>\"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"userMessage\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"The cleaned user message with matched entity names replaced by exact master list values. All other text must remain unchanged.\"\n    },\n    \"chatHistory\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"The cleaned chat history with matched entity names replaced by exact master list values. All other content, structure, and formatting must remain unchanged.\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"userMessage\", \"chatHistory\"],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Construct Off-topic Response",
